<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!-- Mechanism category — primary Blunt tool. Token registry (tokens are global across categories):
         • "Head" — the blunt head's one on-hit incapacitation/control effect per weapon:
           UMW_BellCast (bell-solid cast head, kinetic resonant stun, hits flesh and mechs; StunFor
           max-merges so procs can't lock) OR UMW_ZeusHeaded (electromagnetic stun, mechanoids only —
           the melee port of Odyssey's EMPRounds, named for Royalty's zeushammer and so Royalty-gated)
           OR UMW_DeadBlow (shot-filled head, movement-only stagger — the target keeps fighting, hence
           its higher proc chance).
           (The token was inherited from the removed UMW_Weighted, whose stun duplicated the kinetic
           stun (now UMW_BellCast) and whose heavy-head stat profile duplicated UMW_Heavy/HeadWeighted.)
         • "Ability" — one active per weapon (Odyssey's ability-trait convention): UMW_Piledriver
           here; the same token on UMW_Melee's UMW_Storied keeps a weapon to a single gizmo.
       Untagged pure stat mods (co-roll freely, per the token policy): UMW_Flanged (Blunt-tool AP
       floor — cracking, not piercing) and UMW_Studded (Blunt-tool damage factor). -->
  <WeaponCategoryDef>
    <defName>UMW_Blunt</defName>
    <label>blunt</label>
  </WeaponCategoryDef>

</Defs>
